`block.jsonc`, `README.md`, `scene.jsonc`, `firmware/NOTICE`, `firmware/ring/ring.ino` and
`tests/ring.test` are under MIT OR Apache-2.0.

`build/ring.ino.hex` links the runtime and Adafruit NeoPixel, so it is under LGPL-2.1-or-later and LGPL-3.0-or-later.
`firmware/LICENSE-runtime` is under LGPL-2.1-or-later.
`firmware/LICENSE-neopixel` is under LGPL-3.0-or-later.
`firmware/LICENSE-libc` is under BSD-3-Clause.
`firmware/LICENSE-gcc-exception` holds the GCC Runtime Library Exception 3.1
